1 NOTE English patronymic surname derived from the medieval given name "Hudde"
2 CONT (a pet form of Hugh, "heart/mind," or a variant of Hudson). First recorded
2 CONT as William Hudde in the 1273 Hundred Rolls of Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT This is general surname background, NOT proof of Miles Hutson's specific line.
